{"availability":"available","full":"Laz22y/LazyForza","name":"LazyForza","description":"Forza Horizon 6 UDP telemetry dashboard and lap analysis tool for Windows.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":14,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-24T10:39:27Z","updated":"2026-10-11T03:49:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://laz22y.github.io/LazyForza/","topics":["forza-horizon-6","hud","race"],"demo":"https://laz22y.github.io/LazyForza/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:31.914Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:31.914Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:31.914Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:31.914Z","stars":14,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["当前正式版：1.5.3 · Radio Check（GitCode 镜像）。地产赛事推荐搭配 RaceServer 0.6.0，使用协议 v2。","LazyForza 通过 FH6 官方 UDP Data Out 获取数据，不读取游戏内存、不注入 DLL、不修改游戏进程。设置、圈速、车辆学习和录制默认保存在本机。","1.5.3「Radio Check」新增语音比赛工程师和弯道分析，更新主窗口与设置体验，并改进维修区计圈及赛事连接。"],"features":["The experimental drift HUD is disabled by default and uses local UDP telemetry to show slip angle, control trends and spin-risk guidance.","Track identification accommodates rear grid positions and waits for route divergence when events such as Goliath and Legend Island share an opening corridor. A newly reset race clock and a low vehicle speed at a…","Lap comparison, post-race review and the replay workbench support manually marked corner intervals. Click the start and end points on the racing-line preview, fine-tune the distances if needed, and choose another…","Lap analysis groups saved laps into sessions by default. Estate practice, qualifying, races and solo timing are kept separate; ordinary maps use locally detected game sessions. Select a session to review recorded time,…","Corner comparisons require compatible route revisions, directions, sector versions and vehicle conditions. Older laps remain viewable and replayable. Intervals with sufficient samples provide observation